OpenQiara is an interoperability project under EU Directive 2009/24/EC
(Article 6) and French CPI L122-6-1.IV. It does not redistribute any
proprietary code from Qiara, Free, Iliad, or their suppliers (Cofidur EMS,
Sigmastar, etc.). It runs as an overlay on the camera's stock rootfs and
relies on vendor binaries (charmux, hlcamd, hls, uartboot, kernel modules)
that remain on the device.

Use at your own risk. May void manufacturer warranty. The authors disclaim
any liability for damaged hardware, lost data, or service disruption.
